        "jsCode": "// === Build done-row (WORKAROUND MODE: email-only, no WP API) ===\n// WordPress REST API is blocked by SiteGround; blog is emailed to the host to\n// paste manually. \"done\" here means \"drafts emailed to the host\", consistent\n// with how the Substack newsletter already works. No wp_post_id available.\nreturn [{ json: {\n  guid: $('Parse & validate Claude JSON').first().json.guid,\n  status: 'done',\n  wp_post_id: 'MANUAL-EMAIL',   // sentinel: paste-mode, not API-created\n  completed_at: new Date().toISOString()\n}}];"
